# Working context — the rules, the brief and the brain.
#
# Two different reasons, both worth stating.
#
# The *.local.md files and the per-agent instruction files hold a block RolloutLoud rewrites on
# every launch, and that block carries the live mission — including the engagement scope and its
# target list. Committing them would publish the scope of whatever was last worked on.
#
# CLAUDE.md and PRD.md are not rewritten; they are ignored because they are working context
# rather than product, the same call VACUON made. Consequence that has to be said out loud:
# neither they nor the vault have a GitHub backup.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
AGENTS.local.md
HERMES.md
OPENCLAW.md
PRD.md
scratchpad/

